{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setadvertisingid:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAdvertisingId:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"advertisingId","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"advertisingId","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The advertising identifier string, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" to clear it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK does not collect IDFA automatically. The integrator is responsible for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"requesting user consent via ","type":"text"},{"code":"ATTrackingManager.requestTrackingAuthorization","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passing the resulting identifier to the SDK."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", an empty string, or the zero UUID","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\""},{"type":"text","text":") to clear the identifier on the backend."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The zero UUID is what ","type":"text"},{"code":"ASIdentifierManager.advertisingIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"tracking is denied or restricted — the SDK normalizes it to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Fire-and-forget: no completion handler. The SDK retries on transient failures.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deduplicated: repeated calls with the same value do not produce additional","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"network requests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value is persisted locally only after a successful send and read back on"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"subsequent launches for the dedupe check."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default the IDFA is sent to "},{"code":"https:\/\/tracking.svc-nue.pushwoosh.com\/api\/v2\/device-api\/setMADID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can override the tracking endpoint via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pushwoosh_TRACKING_URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Info.plist key (useful for on-premise deployments and integration testing).","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"App-Store-submission-requirement","text":"App Store submission requirement"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple requires that any tracking domain be declared in the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"integrator’s"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app-level "},{"code":"PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"xml","code":["<key>NSPrivacyTracking<\/key>","<true\/>","<key>NSPrivacyTrackingDomains<\/key>","<array>","    <string>tracking.svc-nue.pushwoosh.com<\/string>","<\/array>"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you override "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pushwoosh_TRACKING_URL"},{"text":", list ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"your","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" host instead. Apps that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ship without this declaration will be blocked by iOS on non-authorized devices"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and may face App Store review issues."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You must also add ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSUserTrackingUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" — it is the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"text displayed in the ATT consent prompt."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import AppTrackingTransparency","import AdSupport","","ATTrackingManager.requestTrackingAuthorization { status in","    if status == .authorized {","        let idfa = ASIdentifierManager.shared().advertisingIdentifier.uuidString","        Pushwoosh.configure.setAdvertisingId(idfa)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To clear:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Pushwoosh.configure.setAdvertisingId(nil)"]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets the advertising identifier (IDFA) for the device.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setAdvertisingId:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setAdvertisingId:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setAdvertisingId:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setAdvertisingId:","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setAdvertisingId:","symbolKind":"method"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setAdvertisingId:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the advertising identifier (IDFA) for the device."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setadvertisingid:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setAdvertisingId:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setAdvertisingId:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAdvertisingId:"}],"title":"setAdvertisingId:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore"}}}